  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORTH PARK WETLANDS CONSERVATION PARTNER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a continuation of NCC&apos;s multi-year commitment to the PHJVs contribution to the North American Waterfowl Management Plan. Accomplishments will include permanent securement of 880 acres of quality migratory bird habitat via fee simple acquisition. NCC will also manage 103,532 acres of habitat secured in previous NAWCA projects. Project activities will benefit breeding waterfowl and will reduce the risk of habitat loss to conversion.</narrative>
  </description>
